    "description": "Mighty Beanz Lot\nCarrying Cases, Storage Tubes, and Loose Figures Collection\nMolded Plastic and Metal, Early 2000s\nThis extensive Mighty Beanz collection includes a large assortment of original early 2000s collectible tumbling bean figures alongside approximately 25 individual plastic carrying cases. First popularized by Moose Toys in the early 2000s, Mighty Beanz became a global schoolyard collectible phenomenon characterized by their distinctive weighted ball bearing center that creates dynamic rolling action.\nLarge lot featuring dozens of assorted character beanz and specialty figures\nIncludes approximately 25 blue, red, and orange clip-on carrying tube cases\nFeatures stamped Mighty Beanz branding on exterior case bodies\nIncludes bonus collector card and storage container with loose assortment\nCondition:\nOverall very good pre-owned condition across all pieces. Figures display clean graphics with light play wear and surface scuffs consistent with age. Plastic carrying cases open, close, and snap shut securely with clean hinge mechanisms. No major cracks, breaks, or structural damage observed throughout the collection.",
